00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:21.420
Now, you could disagree with cap or nick about
the degree to which his priorities should

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:23.820
be priorities in the country.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:29.070
You could say, I simply don't think that Colin
Kaepernick's concerns actually rise to the

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:32.670
level that Colin Kaepernick believes they
should or do.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.670
Okay.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:37.590
Well, I, I disagree with you, but that's an
